            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2917347,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "So can anyone apply to get involved in street play?",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2917348,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So can anyone apply to get involved in street play?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 191.065,
                  "from": 187.305,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2917359,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Absolutely. We want to include all kids in the city, especially those who live on busy roads. It's here that demand is greatest. Obviously, there isn't such demand in wealthier areas where the children have access to parks or large gardens, or in the suburbs where there are usually more places for children to play outside. I'd recommend that anyone listening who likes the idea should just give it a go.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2917360,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Absolutely.",
                "meta": {
