                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2917631,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "It certainly does have a lot of benefits. I want to move on now and ask you about a related project in King Street.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2917632,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It certainly does have a lot of benefits.",
